sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant A as Shopping agent
    participant M as Merchant manifest<br/>ucp_manifest
    participant C as Checkout<br/>ucp_checkout
    A->>M: discover capabilities + catalog
    M-->>A: products, currency, policies
    A->>C: open checkout session (intent)
    C-->>A: proposed cart + total
    Note over V,C: nothing is bought yet
    C-->>V: authorization_required
    V->>C: approve (or reject)
    C-->>A: order confirmed + receipt
